3	// Coverage for the optional IPv4 source network filter on the streaming
4	// entry point. The filter compares the fully normalized source_ip: plain
5	// IPv4 and IPv4-mapped IPv6 spellings share one result, genuine IPv6
6	// addresses (including ::192.0.2.1) never match, and host bits spelled in
7	// the network argument do not narrow the range. Filtering removes only
8	// successful events; failed lines are always emitted with their physical
9	// line number and original reason and still count as failures.
